|desc=
You fold the space between yourself and a second point within a range of 10, creating a pair of wormholes.  Any creature stepping on either wormhole will be teleported near the other (radius {{ctl|1|5|2}} accuracy).  
The wormholes will last {{cts|6|10}} turns and must be placed at least two tiles apart.
The chance of teleporting enemies will scale with your Spellpower.

''Note: Wormholes can be placed in areas that otherwise prohibit teleporation (e.g. vaults), and they will be traversable so long as your destination square allows teleportation.''
